{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#card-zh","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid · 宋律是一款面向 DSH 网页端的主题插件，以宣纸暖白和汝窑天青呈现浅色界面，并以夜墨蓝黑和亮天青呈现深色界面。它通过覆盖主题设计令牌并在“设置 → 通用”加入主题选择器，让用户选择宣纸、夜墨或跟随系统。主题还提供中文宋体排版、山水背景、分层间距与图标样式，以及用于引用块的编辑强调色。主题选择会保存在浏览器本地，并尝试通过 DSH 设置命名空间同步；无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:754-769"]}
{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#card-en","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Songgrid is a DSH web theme with rice-paper light and night-ink dark palettes. Settings offers both variants or system appearance. It adds Chinese Song-serif typography, landscape imagery, spacing and icon styles, and a blockquote accent. Choices are saved locally and may sync through DSH settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:754-769"]}
