{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#feature-1","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid 的功能「浅色与深色配色」：提供宣纸暖白的 Xuanzhi 和夜墨蓝黑的 Yemo 两套色彩令牌，并分别适配明暗模式。 通过启用主题自动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:16"]}
{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#feature-2","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid 的功能「主题选择器」：在设置的通用项目中加入选择行，支持选择宣纸、夜墨或跟随系统。 通过启用主题自动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:754-769"]}
{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#feature-3","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid 的功能「中文宋体排版」：定义 Noto Serif SC 字体，并在主题启用时应用于正文和 Markdown 文本。 通过启用主题自动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:182-205"]}
{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#feature-4","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid 的功能「界面视觉样式」：注入结构尺度、Lucide 图标、语义强调和山水背景等 CSS 层。 通过启用主题自动应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:580-586"]}
{"unit_id":"yefengliu1__dsh-theme-songgrid#caveat-1","repo":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","commit":"bdb2cda5c4d186eaf1539dc18deb676a102ed3e3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Songgrid 使用 Noto Serif SC 中文字体，浏览器会从 registry.npmmirror.com 加载字体文件；字体不可用时 CSS 提供本机字体回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:185-193"]}
